#. Tag: para
#: calc-dayduration.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module computes the length of day as well as sunrise, sun-transit "
"(noon), and sunset times for any calendar date, for any location on Earth. "
"First fill in the desired geographic coordinates and date, then press the "
"<guibutton>Compute</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo calcula a duración do día, así como as horas do amencer, do "
"tránsito solar (mediodía) e do solpor en calquera data do calendario en "
"calquera lugar da terra. Primeiro enche as coordenadas xeográficas e a data "
"desexadas e despois preme o botón <guibutton>Calcular</guibutton>."
